      "role": "user",
      "content": "it didnt feel like an artifact though. it was definitely deliberate. like the intervals between the bright bursts were changing in a way that felt mathematical. if we look at the timing of the pulses i saw, could we try to map them out? if it was a signal, there would have to be a syntax or a bit-rate. can you help me check if there's any known mathematical constants or sequences that would fit a stellar pulse pattern like that?",
